description:
Create (or update) a site in the agent workspace and return its site_id, for the tools that take one (explore_llm_mentions, explore_web_mentions, mine_competitor_prompts, find_content_gap, crawl_site, detect_tech_stack, get_backlink_summary, submit_urls, schedule_recheck). Creates the workspace on first use and returns its API key.

Billing: bundled — free.

Example: { domain: "linear.app", brand: "Linear", competitor_domains: ["asana.com"] }
